  "limits": [
    "Full scenery takes priority over previously partial frames. Strict orchard combat and keep 30 FPS checks still fail; orchard records 372 missed retraces versus 185 with the prior 24 KiB partial-board build.",
    "The new render_hbl interval includes the pre-render GPU completion wait and table clear; it is not an isolated CPU-only comparison against earlier render_hbl measurements.",
    "Emulator results, not physical hardware validation. Campaign menu/save tests use supported stage skip; separate combat and reveal probes use legal gameplay.",
    "The 543 matches compare complete-geometry references, not pixel identity to the old clipped orchard. Larger creator scenes still require command-space and RAM audits."
  ],
  "upstream": "Application-only allocation/synchronization changes. Existing optional packet hooks remain local; no additional Mipsync patch or public PR update."
}
